(;CA[Windows-1252]ST[2]PM[2]FG[259:]OT[3x30 Byo-yomi ]RU[Japanese]FF[4]C[WAGC 2010
Hangzhou, China
Round 2, May 26
W\: Thomas Hsiang 7d (US)
B\: Thomas Debarre 5d (France)
Commentary by Michael Redmond 9P
Transcribed by Chris Garlock

I know both players; Debarre was in Japan recently, I think, studying, though I don't know the details. Hsiang is a longtime friend of my wife and her sisters, so I know him well; he's a strong amateur. When I saw him the night after this game, he was saying that he had a fairly bad case of jetlag.]
